      "title": {
        "en": "Caring and affectionate daycare walkers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners praise the dog walkers for their warmth, attentiveness, and patience with dogs of all sizes. Clients report that their dogs build strong bonds with staff and eagerly wait by the door for daily pickups. While two reviewers had negative experiences with management and contractor oversight, the vast majority describe devoted carers."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Rich socialisation and safe play"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently describe dogs returning home tired, happy, and well socialised after playing with compatible dog groups. Pet parents appreciate that staff group dogs by size and temperament and provide attentive supervision. Although one owner reported an injury during a walk, most clients feel confident leaving their dogs in the centre care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Daily photo updates and messaging"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients regularly commend the team for sending cute photos and daily activity updates that provide peace of mind while owners work. Many note easy scheduling and responsive email interactions. However, two reviewers experienced communication difficulties with management regarding booking changes and handling issues."
      }
    }
  ],
